# SafePayout

AI-assisted payout manager built on PayPal Payouts. An LLM cleans and flags messy payout sheets, a rules engine enforces limits, and a human approves before money moves.

## Local development

Copy this file to `.env` and adjust values before running the app.

```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

### Backend

```env
APP_ENV=development
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./safepayout.db
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173

GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash

PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID=
PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET=
PAYPAL_WEBHOOK_ID=
PAYPAL_BASE_URL=https://api-m.sandbox.paypal.com
```

### Frontend

```env
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
```
